OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 6 MAY
OL,4,G1930FJo Whiley
OL,5,     GJo handpicks her favourite new
OL,6,     Gmusic from all genres of the
OL,7,     Gmusical spectrum and quality
OL,8,     Gvintage songs too.
OL,9,G2100FThe Folk Show with Mark Radcliffe
OL,10,     GMark's pick of folk and acoustic
OL,11,     Gmusic. Jim Moray drops in to
OL,12,     Gshare tracks from his new album,
OL,13,     GGallants.
OL,14,G2200FThe Good Groove with Angellica
OL,15,     FBell
OL,16,     GFeelgood tunes to make you
OL,17,     Ggroove, from soulful house to
OL,18,     GRnB, disco to doo-wop and
OL,19,     Geverything else in-between. Join
OL,20,     Gin with addictive guessing game
OL,21,     G'Music Is The Answer'.
